# Personal VPS management scripts. Ignored, except the disk-cleanup script:
# cron and the NOPASSWD sudoers rule hard-code its path, so losing it (a repo
# cleanup deleted it in 2026-08) let the disk refill silently. Keep it tracked.
infra/*
!infra/vps-disk-cleanup.sh

